**QA student:** Pablo Villeda GUA | **Execution export:** `MINIMODA-Express+run+2026_10_28.csv`

## Defect: Cart allows quantities exceeding available inventory

**Status:** Failed | **Priority:** High | **Severity:** Critical (as recorded in Qase)  
**Type:** Functional | **Automation:** To be automated

**Observed behavior:** The product page permits adding more units to the cart than the available inventory. The Qase run notes that **“El Gorrito de Lana Osito Bebe 0-2”** has **25 units in stock**, but the user can attempt to add more than 25. This could mislead customers about availability and create an overselling or checkout risk. **An actual incorrect charge was not established by this run.**

